{"id":"c5683a01aaf0e04a","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-thm-partition-ordinal.md","title":"Partition Calculus","display":"thm-partition-ordinal — Partition Calculus","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-partition-ordinal","aliases":["58-thm-partition-ordinal"],"display":"thm-partition-ordinal — Partition Calculus","depends_on":["[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-order-type.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-partition-ordinal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-partition-ordinal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-partition-ordinal — Partition Calculus"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5d2cd56a38a81b7a\" href=\"?note=5d2cd56a38a81b7a\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-order-type.md\">../batch11/58-df-order-type.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha, \\beta\">\\(\\alpha, \\beta\\)</span> (序数)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\">\\(\\gamma\\)</span> (nonzero finite cardinal)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (ordinal and cardinal predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrderType}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{OrderType}_S\\)</span> (order-type predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PartitionArrow}_S(\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma,1)\">\\(\\operatorname{PartitionArrow}_S(\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma,1)\\)</span> (partition-arrow predicate, 本文件定义)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}partition\\text{-}ordinal}\\vdash \\operatorname{PartitionArrow}_S(\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma,1)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\gamma)\\land0&lt;\\gamma&lt;\\omega\\land\\forall f\\in\\gamma^\\alpha\\;\\exists H\\subseteq\\alpha\\;\\exists c\\in\\gamma\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{OrderType}_S(\\beta,H,\\in\\cap H^2)\\land\\forall\\eta\\in H\\;(f(\\eta)=c)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}partition\\text{-}ordinal}\\vdash \\operatorname{PartitionArrow}_S(\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma,1)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\gamma)\\land0&lt;\\gamma&lt;\\omega\\land\\forall f\\in\\gamma^\\alpha\\;\\exists H\\subseteq\\alpha\\;\\exists c\\in\\gamma\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{OrderType}_S(\\beta,H,\\in\\cap H^2)\\land\\forall\\eta\\in H\\;(f(\\eta)=c)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Partition calculus studies colorings and homogeneous sets.</li>\n<li>The displayed formula is the exponent-<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> arrow. Separately, Ramsey's theorem gives <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\to(\\omega)^2_n\">\\(\\omega\\to(\\omega)^2_n\\)</span> for every nonzero finite <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-order-type.md","status":"resolved","id":"5d2cd56a38a81b7a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-order-type.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha, \\beta","display":false},{"tex":"\\gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OrderType}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PartitionArrow}_S(\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma,1)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}partition\\text{-}ordinal}\\vdash \\operatorname{PartitionArrow}_S(\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma,1)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\gamma)\\land0<\\gamma<\\omega\\land\\forall f\\in\\gamma^\\alpha\\;\\exists H\\subseteq\\alpha\\;\\exists c\\in\\gamma\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{OrderType}_S(\\beta,H,\\in\\cap H^2)\\land\\forall\\eta\\in H\\;(f(\\eta)=c)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega\\to(\\omega)^2_n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false}],"bytes":1326,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4345","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-thm-partition-ordinal.md|58-thm-partition-ordinal]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["5582a281f15a33c2","5fb1c2241d1943d1","5d2cd56a38a81b7a"]}